# Ecopoints Validity Period

This scope calculates the start and end dates for which ecopoints are valid.

```catala
declaration scope EcopointsValidity:
  input attribution_start_date content date # 1 January of the attribution year
  output valid_start_date content date
  output valid_end_date content date
```

## Ecopoints Validity

Ecopoints are valid from 1 January of the year for which they are attributed and 31 January of the following year.

```catala
scope EcopointsValidity:
  date round down
  definition valid_start_date equals attribution_start_date
  definition valid_end_date equals (attribution_start_date + 1 year) - 1 day
```